      "bullets": [
        "Unsecured inter-agent message boards expose autonomous OpenAI agent workflows to hijacking, rogue coordination, and unauthorized command-and-control exploitation.",
        "Multi-agent communication protocols lack standardized mutual authentication, enabling prompt injection payloads to propagate across interconnected agent instances.",
        "Engineers deploying agentic systems must enforce strict network isolation, message signing, and egress controls on inter-agent messaging channels."
      ]
    },
